# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Backend (server/) — copy to .env or export before `npm run dev`
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Network. MAINNET IS THE DEFAULT — orders here spend real funds.
# Set to 1 to work against testnet instead.
SODEX_TESTNET=0

# Mainnet writes are enabled by default. Set to 0 for a read-only setup.
VALUETRADE_ALLOW_MAINNET=1

# Where the encrypted API key is stored (defaults to server/.keystore.json).
# VALUETRADE_KEYSTORE=

# ValueChain RPC used for deposits. The defaults are the public endpoints;
# override to use your own node.
# VALUECHAIN_RPC=https://rpc.valuechain.xyz
# VALUECHAIN_TESTNET_RPC=https://testnet-rpc.valuechain.xyz

# Optional headless bootstrap — skips the keystore and unlocks at boot.
# Use the API key's private key, NEVER your wallet's.
# SODEX_PRIVATE_KEY=0x...
#
# IGNORED unless you also set VALUETRADE_ALLOW_ENV_KEY=1, on purpose.
# This file is plaintext and sits inside the project folder, which is cloud-synced -
# a raw signing key here is worse than the encrypted keystore the app no longer writes.
# The normal flow needs none of this: it mints a key in memory from one wallet signature.
# VALUETRADE_ALLOW_ENV_KEY=0

# Leaderboard index. The server process walks the tracked traders itself and
# every visitor reads the same file. Leave this on for the one production
# process. Set VALUETRADE_TRADER_INDEX=0 only on extra nodes that must not walk.
# Point the file at a disk that survives deploys.
# VALUETRADE_TRADER_INDEX=1
# VALUETRADE_TRADER_INDEX_DB=/var/lib/valuescan/trader-index.db
# SODEX_API_KEY=my-bot-key-01
# SODEX_ACCOUNT_ID=12345
# SODEX_ADDRESS=0xYourMasterWallet

# The News widget (/api/vs/news) reads SoSoValue's OpenAPI. Key from
# https://sosovalue.com/developer/dashboard ; deploy/release/set-sosovalue-key.sh
# writes it here and on production, asking for it. Without it the widget says so.
# SOSOVALUE_API_KEY=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Frontend (web/.env.local) — Vite only exposes VITE_* to the browser
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Required for WalletConnect QR pairing. Free, takes a minute:
#   https://dashboard.reown.com  ->  create a project  ->  copy the Project ID
# Without it, extension wallets still work; only the QR flow is disabled.
# VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id_here
